<title>INDIA: Bombay share index drops 63.16 pts near close.</title>
<headline>Bombay share index drops 63.16 pts near close.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 30-share benchmark index of the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) fell 63.16 points, or 2.15 percent, to 2,878.20 near close on Thursday after the market rebounded 5.1 percent on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Traders said the market was hit by unwinding of positions after the prices rose too fast.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
